#!/bin/sh
# Erzeugt /usr/lib/os-release fuer Teria aus dem umgeleiteten Original (Ubuntu oder Debian).
# Auf Ubuntu bleibt ID=ubuntu (apt, PPAs); auf Debian wird ID=teria, ID_LIKE=debian.
set -e
ORIG=/usr/lib/os-release.ubuntu
OUT=/usr/lib/os-release
[ -r "$ORIG" ] || exit 0
VER=$(cat /usr/lib/teria/version 2>/dev/null || echo 0)
# shellcheck source=/dev/null
UVER=$(. "$ORIG"; echo "$VERSION_ID")
# shellcheck source=/dev/null
BASE=$(. "$ORIG"; echo "$ID")
# shellcheck source=/dev/null
BASENAME=$(. "$ORIG"; echo "$NAME")
tmp=$(mktemp "$OUT.XXXXXX")
{
    if [ "$BASE" = debian ]; then
        # Eigenstaendiges Teria: eigene ID, Debian als Verwandter
        grep -v -E '^(ID|ID_LIKE|NAME|PRETTY_NAME|VARIANT|VARIANT_ID|HOME_URL|BUG_REPORT_URL|SUPPORT_URL|LOGO|IMAGE_VERSION|BUILD_ID|VERSION|VERSION_ID)=' "$ORIG"
        echo "ID=teria"
        echo "ID_LIKE=debian"
        echo "VERSION=\"$VER\""
        echo "VERSION_ID=\"$VER\""
        echo "DEBIAN_VERSION_ID=\"$UVER\""
    else
        # Schicht ueber Ubuntu: ID=ubuntu bleibt fuer apt und PPAs
        grep -v -E '^(NAME|PRETTY_NAME|VARIANT|VARIANT_ID|HOME_URL|BUG_REPORT_URL|SUPPORT_URL|LOGO|IMAGE_VERSION|BUILD_ID)=' "$ORIG"
    fi
    echo "NAME=\"Teria\""
    echo "PRETTY_NAME=\"Teria $VER ($BASENAME $UVER, Switchroot L4T)\""
    echo "VARIANT=\"Teria\""
    echo "VARIANT_ID=teria"
    echo "BUILD_ID=$VER"
    echo "HOME_URL=\"https://github.com/gigafrosxh/auto-injector-switch-v1\""
    echo "BUG_REPORT_URL=\"https://github.com/gigafrosxh/auto-injector-switch-v1/issues\""
    echo "SUPPORT_URL=\"https://github.com/gigafrosxh/auto-injector-switch-v1\""
} > "$tmp"
chmod 644 "$tmp"
mv -f "$tmp" "$OUT"
